{
  "provider": "isolved",
  "entity": "payroll",
  "notes": [
    "PayrollRun per payrollRunHistory entry (legal, entry id), read from the full history of each pay group, never a year-filtered one (D-050); pay_periods[].pay_group_id from the route's paygroupId. finalized_date is null with not_provided.",
    "Paycheck per check (legal, check id). The legal check list only enumerates checks (it returns the same CheckModel as the detail, with taxes empty, D-016); each check is read from the detail route, the record source. payroll_run_id joins (check date, payrollRunNumber) to a completed run (430 of 430, D-050); no match leaves it null with not_provided. Only exactly one completed run of the legal is linked: a match with only a run not processed, or with several completed runs, is null with conflicting_sources; no match while a run history of the legal returned 404 (no confirmed meaning, D-011) is null with source_unavailable (D-089). A listed check whose detail is missing or [] is kept with its ids, company and employee only, the rest not_provided with source_unavailable (D-089). Check status and pay_group_id are null with not_provided.",
    "Lines: earnings[] earning lines, deductions[] and garnishments[] deduction lines (garnishments with category garnishment), taxes[] tax lines (paid_by from isEmployeeTax), benefits[] benefit lines (not additive: their employee amounts repeat deduction lines, 50 of 50). Line ids and the catalog: an earning or deduction line id is the catalog item id (205 of 205, D-066); a garnishment line id is the employee's garnishment id (80 of 80 live, D-095), kept raw.",
    "Memo earnings (isMemoEarning true) whose itemDescription is in isolved.memo_label become employer contribution lines (D-055, inferred, an inferred_mapping diagnostic per line), with earning_code_id the memo item; others stay earning lines with pay_class memo. Each memo-derived line's isMemoEarning flag is kept in the Paycheck's provider_extensions (D-055).",
    "Payments: checkAmount is one payment line with method check (raw_code 'checkAmount'); each directDeposits[] item a direct_deposit line. direct_deposit_id is null with not_provided: the line id is not shown to be a deposit id (all 430 live checks have directDepositAmount 0).",
    "Tax type and jurisdiction level from the exact itemDescription (isolved.tax_label, inferred, D-056); itemCode is null on the live lines. jurisdiction is null with not_provided."
  ],
